<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="House of Barfi — handcrafted mithai and barfi, cut fresh and boxed to order. Classic barfi, mixed mithai trays, and individual pieces sold by the box or the pound.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' fill='%235B1B2E'/%3E%3Crect x='25' y='25' width='50' height='50' rx='6' fill='%23C99A3D' transform='rotate(45 50 50)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<title>House of Barfi — Handcrafted mithai, boxed to order</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rozha+One&family=Mukta:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --cream: #F6EEDD;
    --cream-2: #EFE4CC;
    --maroon: #5B1B2E;
    --maroon-2: #431422;
    --gold: #C99A3D;
    --gold-light: #E4C077;
    --pistachio: #7C9463;
    --rose: #C97B85;
    --ink: #2B1B16;
    --ink-soft: #5A4740;
    --white: #FFFDF8;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  h1, h2, h3, .display {
    font-family: 'Rozha One', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--maroon);
    margin: 0;
  }

  a { color: inherit; }

  img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1160px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 28px;
  }

  /* ---------- header ---------- */

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 40;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .header-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 18px 0;
  }

  .logo {
    font-family: 'Rozha One', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--maroon);
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .logo span {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  nav a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 6px 2px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  nav a:hover { border-color: var(--gold); }

  .cart-btn {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cart-btn:hover { background: var(--maroon-2); }

  .cart-count {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--maroon-2);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    min-width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 5px;
  }

  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */

  .hero {
    padding: 76px 0 88px;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 52px;
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .hero p.lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--maroon-2); }
  .btn-primary:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

  .link-quiet {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--maroon);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--gold);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* diamond tray */

  .tray {
    position: relative;
    height: 380px;
  }

  .diamond {
    position: absolute;
    width: 92px;
    height: 92px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 18px -8px rgba(43, 27, 22, 0.35);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: settle 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  .diamond span {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.16);
  }

  @keyframes settle {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(-18px) scale(0.85); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .diamond { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ---------- shop ---------- */

  .shop {
    background: var(--white);
    padding: 88px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(43,27,22,0.08);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(43,27,22,0.08);
  }

  .section-head {
    max-width: 58ch;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .section-head p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 16.5px;
  }

  .product-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .product-card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(43,27,22,0.1);
  }

  .product-visual {
    height: 200px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .product-visual .diamond {
    position: static;
    animation: none;
    opacity: 1;
    width: 58px;
    height: 58px;
  }

  .product-visual-photo {
    padding: 0;
    height: 200px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .product-visual-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .price-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    right: -34px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--maroon-2);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 6px 40px;
    transform: rotate(35deg);
    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(43,27,22,0.2);
  }

  .product-body {
    padding: 26px 26px 28px;
    border-top: 2px dashed rgba(43,27,22,0.15);
  }

  .product-body h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .product-body p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .product-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .qty-stepper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--maroon);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .qty-stepper button {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--maroon);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
  }

  .qty-stepper button:hover { background: rgba(91,27,46,0.08); }

  .qty-stepper input {
    width: 32px;
    text-align: center;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
  }

  .add-btn {
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .add-btn:hover { background: var(--maroon-2); }

  /* ---------- story ---------- */

  .story {
    padding: 92px 0;
  }

  .story-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .story h2 {
    font-size: 34px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .story p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 16.5px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .quote {
    font-family: 'Rozha One', serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--maroon);
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .jali {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .ingredient-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ingredient-pill {
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid rgba(43,27,22,0.15);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ingredient-pill .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */

  footer {
    background: var(--maroon-2);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 56px 0 32px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  footer h4 {
    font-family: 'Rozha One', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }

  footer .tagline {
    color: rgba(246,238,221,0.75);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    max-width: 32ch;
  }

  footer .foot-col p, footer .foot-col a {
    display: block;
    color: rgba(246,238,221,0.85);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  footer .foot-col a:hover { color: var(--gold-light); }

  .foot-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: none;
    color: rgba(246,238,221,0.5);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .foot-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(246,238,221,0.15);
    padding-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(246,238,221,0.55);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* ---------- cart drawer ---------- */

  .overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(43,27,22,0.4);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
    z-index: 50;
  }

  .overlay.open {
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .drawer {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: 400px;
    max-width: 90vw;
    background: var(--white);
    z-index: 60;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.8,0.3,1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: -12px 0 30px rgba(43,27,22,0.15);
  }

  .drawer.open { transform: translateX(0); }

  .drawer-head {
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .drawer-head h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .drawer-close {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--maroon);
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 4px;
  }

  .drawer-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .drawer-empty {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 15px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  .cart-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(43,27,22,0.1);
  }

  .cart-line .swatch {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    border-radius: 5px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin: 8px;
  }

  .cart-line-info { flex: 1; }

  .cart-line-info .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .cart-line-info .price {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cart-line-remove {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
  }

  .drawer-foot {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 20px 24px 26px;
  }

  .subtotal-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .checkout-btn {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .checkout-btn:hover { background: var(--maroon-2); }

  .checkout-note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  /* checkout placeholder modal */

  .modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 70;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .modal.open { display: flex; }

  .modal-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 12px;
    max-width: 420px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 34px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(43,27,22,0.25);
  }

  .modal-card .diamond {
    position: static;
    animation: none;
    opacity: 1;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }

  .modal-card h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .modal-card p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .modal-close-btn {
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 26px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
  }

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero-inner, .story-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 38px; }
    .tray { height: 260px; order: -1; }
    .product-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    nav .nav-links { display: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .wrap { padding: 0 18px; }
    .hero { padding: 48px 0 60px; }
    .drawer { width: 100%; }
  }

  /* ---------- full menu ---------- */

  .menu-section {
    padding: 88px 0;
  }

  .menu-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0 56px;
  }

  .menu-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(43,27,22,0.18);
  }

  .menu-row-info h4 {
    font-family: 'Rozha One', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--maroon);
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .menu-row-info p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .menu-row-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .menu-row-price {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--maroon);
    font-size: 15px;
    min-width: 42px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .menu-row .qty-stepper button { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 15px; }
  .menu-row .qty-stepper input { width: 24px; font-size: 13.5px; }

  .menu-category {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 34px 0 6px;
  }

  .menu-category:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .menu-category h3 {
    font-family: 'Rozha One', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .menu-row-icon.diamond {
    position: static;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    animation: none;
    opacity: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .menu-row-icon-photo {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .menu-row-icon-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .menu-row-info { flex: 1; }

  .add-btn-sm {
    background: var(--maroon);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .add-btn-sm:hover { background: var(--maroon-2); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .menu-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .menu-row { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .menu-row-right { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap header-inner">
    <a href="#" class="logo">House of <span>Barfi</span></a>
    <nav>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#shop">Shop</a>
        <a href="#menu">Full menu</a>
        <a href="#story">Our story</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <button class="cart-btn" id="cartOpenBtn" aria-label="Open cart">
        Cart <span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">0</span>
      </button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div>
      <h1>Small boxes, cut by hand, sweetened for celebration.</h1>
      <p class="lede">House of Barfi makes small batches of barfi and mixed mithai the way it's meant to be — real ghee, toasted nuts, and no shortcuts. Boxed fresh to order.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#shop" class="btn-primary">Shop the boxes</a>
        <a href="#story" class="link-quiet">How it's made</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tray" id="heroTray"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="shop" id="shop">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>The boxes</h2>
      <p>Three ways to bring mithai to the table. Every box is cut and packed the day it ships.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="product-grid">

      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="price-tag">$18</div>
        <div class="product-visual product-visual-photo">
          <img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Classic khoya barfi, cut into thick squares">
        </div>
        <div class="product-body">
          <h3>Classic barfi box</h3>
          <p>Milk barfi, cut thick and finished with a whisper of cardamom and pistachio. One flavor, done right. 12 pieces.</p>
          <div class="product-controls">
            <div class="qty-stepper" data-qty-for="classic">
              <button type="button" data-action="dec">−</button>
              <input type="text" value="1" readonly>
              <button type="button" data-action="inc">+</button>
            </div>
            <button class="add-btn" data-add="classic" data-name="Classic barfi box" data-price="18">Add to box</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-card">
        <div class="price-tag">$20</div>
        <div class="product-visual product-visual-photo">
          <img loading="lazy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Mithai mix box — an assortment of barfi, kalakand, laddoo, and halwa varieties">
        </div>
        <div class="product-body">
          <h3>Mithai mix box</h3>
          <p>A tour of the counter — barfi, kalakand, laddoo, halwa, and more, side by side. Good for gifting, better for sharing. 16 pieces.</p>
          <div class="product-controls">
            <div class="qty-stepper" data-qty-for="mix">
